(1) Indicate clearly the $5$ asymptotic regions: future time-like infinity, past time-like infinity, spatial infinity, future null infinity, past null infinity. [8 Points]

(2) Indicate clearly the black hole horizon and the singularity of the spacetime. [8 Points]

